/Title (This dashboard monitors 4G busy-hour network quality across Jakarta-Banten, with region tabs \(Banten, Tangerang, DKI Jakarta, Bekasi-Depok\) plus 5G KPI and KQI pages. Nine trend panels show time-series KPIs per cell, such as throughput, latency, and allocation failures, and each panel has its own KPI selector for side-by-side comparison. Filters for date, ROH cluster, Tower ID, site, and cell narrow the view down to a single cell.)
