/Title (This dashboard tracks daily payload by PLMN \(4G SF, 4G XL, 5G XLSMART\) alongside network availability \(NAV\) for Jakarta-Banten, with KPI cards for total sites, average availability, and average payload. Detail tables below cover MOCN site status, new site progress, and cell configuration \(RAT, band, MIMO, bandwidth\) per tower. Users can filter by date, Tower ID, PLMN, and region.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 379 0 R
>>
endobj
402 0 obj
<<
/Title (This map-based dashboard tracks 5G MOCN rollout progress by kecamatan. Each area is shaded by completion percentage across five classes \(0-5% to 95-100%\), so teams can see at a glance where rollout is advanced and where it is still behind. KPI cards summarize completed sites, sites not yet done \(NY Done\), and the overall completion rate, while a stacked bar chart compares Done and Not yet Done by kabupaten. A kabupaten slicer lets users focus on a single region.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 400 0 R
>>
